```markdown
---
marp: true
---

<style>
section {
  background-color: #f8f8f4;
  font-family: 'Noto Sans JP', sans-serif;
}

h1 {
  color: #4f86c6;
}
</style>

# Slide
```

This method allows applying custom styles without using a theme.
